{"id":"7ba5f2cd8dcf5eb7","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-measure5-almost-everywhere-equal.md","title":"ZFC Measure5 Almost Everywhere Equal","display":"df-zfc-measure5-almost-everywhere-equal — ZFC Measure5 Almost Everywhere Equal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure5-almost-everywhere-equal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure5-almost-everywhere-equal"],"display":"df-zfc-measure5-almost-everywhere-equal — ZFC Measure5 Almost Everywhere Equal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure5-almost-everywhere-equal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-almost-everywhere-equal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure5-almost-everywhere-equal — ZFC Measure5 Almost Everywhere Equal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure\">../batch13/58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,g\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,g\\in V\\)</span> (carriers, sigma algebra, measure, and function graphs)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure\">../batch13/58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S\\)</span> (almost-everywhere-equality predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}almost\\text{-}everywhere\\text{-}equal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,f,g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\\land\n\\exists N\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\\mu(N)=0\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\notin N\\to f(x)=g(x))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}almost\\text{-}everywhere\\text{-}equal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5AlmostEverywhereEqual}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,f,g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\\land\n\\exists N\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\\mu(N)=0\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\notin N\\to f(x)=g(x))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equality almost everywhere is equality off a null set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","tex